            <ArticleTitle>Endoscopic management of late complication of blunt traumatic total pancreatic transection.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>735-736</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An 11-year-old girl was admitted elsewhere due to severe abdominal pain after a fall with abdominal blunt trauma. CT-scan showed total pancreatic transection of the distal body with suspected injury of main pancreatic duct.</AbstractText>
